---
// One extra hop to AuthGate.astro, giving the fixture a LONGER path to a violating
// module than the two pages that render AuthGate directly. That is what makes
// findPageChain's "keep the shortest" comparison load-bearing: the page that renders
// this wrapper sorts ahead of both of those, so a checker that simply reported the
// first route it walked would print this four-hop chain instead of the three-hop one.
//
// This component imports AuthGate, not auth, so it is not itself a violation.
import AuthGate from './AuthGate.astro';
---

<AuthGate />
